Package: mht
Title: Menopausal Hormone Therapy Exposure Definitions for Swedish Registry Data
Version: 26.8.3.1
Authors@R: person(c("Richard","Aubrey"), "White", email = "hello@rwhite.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6747-1726"))
Description: Derives menopausal hormone therapy (MHT) exposure from Swedish
    prescription registry (LMED) data. Categorises dispensed product names into
    MHT groups, corrects dispensed durations for products whose recorded defined
    daily doses are unreliable, and bridges gaps between consecutive
    prescriptions. Applies the approach-based exposure definitions used by the
    Skalkidou-lab MHT studies to person-week skeletons of the form produced by
    'swereg', on which it does not depend.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
